# Mode$ BecomesPlotted (Card.java:6770, triggerpack.go): plotting Longhorn
# Sharpshooter for {3}{R} exiles it plotted and fires its "when this
# becomes plotted": 2 damage to the opponent.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets ai
plot human 1
resolvestack
